# HAT TRICK, 2-10: the Kingpin, a big pin, runs round and round the edges of
# the lanes (along the floor, up a wall, along the ceiling, down the other
# wall) throwing cans at you. The demo player beats it.
game hattrick
wait 5
cheat level 20
cheat skipintro
cheat god
expect foes_13 == 1
expect hp_13 == 15
expect fy_13 > 140
waituntil fx_13 < 20 300
waituntil fy_13 < 30 300
waituntil fx_13 > 300 400
waituntil shots_5 >= 1 400
cheat mortal
cheat spare 0 99
botuntil foes == 0 9000
expect falling == 5
